[See Table M for Math Placement](#Table_M)

Presents elementary statistical methods and concepts including visual data presentation, descriptive statistics, probability, estimation, hypothesis testing, correlation and linear regression. Emphasis is placed on the development of statistical thinking, simulation, and the use of statistical software. \*This is a Passport Transfer course. Lecture 3 hours, Total 3 hours per week.
